            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>Our fragrances are much more than simple perfumed water. You get a high-quality Eau de Parfum (EdP) with 20% fragrance oils: long-lasting, with strong projection and depth.</p><p>Unlike light body sprays or scented waters, our compositions last up to 12 hours on your skin. So you enjoy an intense, refined scent experience for a fraction of the price of luxury brands.</p>",
