        "collapsible_tab_pCrhqV": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do MagyX's fragrances smell the same as designer fragrances?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>The same fragrance notes. The same concentration. The same craftsmanship.&nbsp;</p><p>We recreate every fragrance with high-quality oils and a careful blending technique, so yes, it smells exactly like the fragrance that costs five times as much.&nbsp;</p><p>In blind tests, people can't tell them apart. The only difference? You're not paying for a designer logo or a sculpture-shaped glass bottle.&nbsp;</p><p>The luxury is in the scent – and that's exactly what you get.</p>",
            "page": ""
